  1096	    (_BUILD_TERMINAL_STATUSES — NOT IDLE) — the true instant the build went terminal. NOT the max
  1097	    timestamp across ALL events (a durable event appended AFTER the terminal status would push the
  1098	    anchor past a real post-terminal provider call), and NOT anchored on IDLE (the rest/kill state).
  1099	    None if no build-terminal status event is present."""
