     3	Two distinct invariants, with two distinct evidence requirements:
     4	
     5	  * WRITE_TOOL_ATTEMPTED_IN_PLANNING — PROVABLE FROM THE EVENT LOG ALONE. A
     6	    mutating action (anything not on the planning-safe read/ask allowlist) appears
