    13	    advertised set ("a hidden tool is still unsafe if it remains callable"). The
    14	    durable event log does NOT persist the offered/allowed tool schemas, so proving
    15	    a write tool was ALLOWED (callable) needs the runner to capture the per-turn
    16	    tool scope. That capture is the LATER live-runner slice (S3). Until then this
    17	    oracle reports SKIP for the ALLOWED check when no `tool_scope` evidence is
