   209	
   210	    A user message is `kind == "message"` AND `source == "user"`. (The message's
   211	    own role is also "user", but the event source is the durable provenance signal
   212	    the security/UI layers use, so we key on it — §1.6.)"""
   213	    return any(
   214	        kind_of(e) == KIND_MESSAGE
   215	        and source_of(e) == SRC_USER
   216	        and seq_of(e) > after_seq
   217	        for e in events
   218	    )
